# Repository ownership
#
# ReferenceApplication currently operates with one active maintainer. CODEOWNERS
# records ownership and review routing without treating self-review as independent
# approval. The versioned branch rulesets therefore require pull requests, dismiss
# stale reviews, require resolved review threads and required CI, but do not require
# Code Owner approval while the solo-maintainer posture applies.
#
# Revisit the approval and Code Owner settings when a second active maintainer is
# appointed.

